tent": "useful"}], "id": 8, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "tools"}], "id": 9, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "for"}], "id": 10, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "people"}], "id": 11, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "who"}], "id": 12, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "want"}], "id": 13, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "to"}], "id": 14, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "create"}], "id": 15, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "Art."}], "id": 16, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "... useful tools for people who ..."}], "type": "question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "id": 3}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "wsb_placeholder"}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "wsb_placeholder"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "rec", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "id": 4}], "type": "WSB", "id": 12, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " The Most Creative Tool in Art"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 3"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Organize the mystery sentence.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Move each word to place it in the correct order.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Record yourself saying the sentences aloud.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Check your pronunciation with an instructor.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  You have 2 attempts to submit your answers."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "template_override": 1}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "video", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "enpe8n4le02ob03re2vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><strong>Paul: </strong>I can&rsquo;t believe what they did to this movie. The new version looks so fake.<br/>", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<strong>Sally</strong>: Why do you say that?<br/>", "time": "4000"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<strong>Paul</strong>: It&rsquo;s the special effects, they made them using computers, but they look terrible.<br/>", "time": "5200"}, {"image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<strong>Sally</strong>: You know that technology is used constantly in the media. I can tell you that doing all that work is not easy. In fact, I think it&rsquo;s an art.<br/>", "time": "9000"}, {"image": "", "id": 4, "text": "<strong>Paul</strong>: How can that be considered art?<br/>", "time": "18000"}, {"image": "", "id": 5, "text": "<strong>Sally</strong>: Because it implies the use of creativity and imagination. The images or media that result from this process are unique and an expression of the artist.<br/>", "time": "19700"}, {"image": "", "id": 6, "text": "<strong>Paul</strong>: This movie it&rsquo;s the plainest form of art, if you ask me.</br>", "time": "28300"}, {"image": "", "id": 7, "text": "<strong>Sally</strong>: Maybe. As in any piece of art there are some people who think it&rsquo;s the most impressive or atrocious piece. It&rsquo;s all in your perception. But I agree that they did a very bad job with this movie. Using technology can&rsquo;t compensate for a lack of talent.<br/>", "time": "31000"}, {"image": "", "id": 8, "text": "<strong>Paul</strong>: You&rsquo;re right. I&rsquo;ve seen some of the most amazing effects in movies, and they were created using computers. I&rsquo;ve also seen some beautiful images that have been enhanced with digital tools, so it&rsquo;s not that I think everything is bad.</br>", "time": "46000"}, {"image": "", "id": 9, "text": "<strong>Sally</strong>: Definitely. I think that art can be linked to technology; it&rsquo;s basically a tool that artists can use, as brushes, paint or canvases. It&rsquo;s undeniable that technology has become an essential part in the artistic process, because it allows artists to use newer features that didn&rsquo;t exist before.<br/>", "time": "58000"}, {"image": "", "id": 10, "text": "<strong>Paul</strong>: You&rsquo;re right. I saw one of the most incredible works of art in an interactive museum. Over there, people can touch the pieces, they can take photos, the works are like chameleons and change all the time. It was the most jaw-dropping thing I&rsquo;ve ever seen.</div>", "time": "76000"}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 5}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Art and the Computer"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about digital arts."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify key information about people's jobs and places of work in spoken or written contexts.  Identify and recognize information related to concepts about graphic design related to IT."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.   Exchanges simple information on the design of an information system, computer architecture and hardware, and basic concepts on graphic design."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Superlatives (Long Adjectives)"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>You use the <strong>superlative </strong>to show the highest possible degree of an adjective. However, the rule that we have to follow to form it varies depending on <strong>the length of the adjective</strong>.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "As in any piece of art there are some people who think it's the most impressive or atrocious piece."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've seen some of the most amazing effects in movies, and they were created using computers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p>English has short and <strong>long adjectives</strong>, we can identify them by the number of syllables they have. In this case, an adjective that has no more than two syllables is a short one and those that have more than two, are considered long.</p> <p>As the superlative represents, in this case, the highest level of a long adjective, the rule that you have to follow to form it is the following:</p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>the most/the least + adjective (base form)</strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>Examples:</p> <p><strong><i>The most challenging</i></strong><i>&nbsp;</i><i>part of designing is to decide the format.</i></p> <p><i> Even&nbsp;<strong>the most advanced</strong>&nbsp;program can't replicate classic art.</i></p> <p><i>I think that&rsquo;s <strong>the least elaborated</strong> piece of art, I&rsquo;ve ever seen. </i></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>Look at the following chart to identify some long adjectives:</p> <p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Long Adjectives\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Interesting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Difficult\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Relaxing \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Authentic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Dangerous \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Boring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Important \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Enormous\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Digital Art"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Thanks to powerful designing tools, content creators are developing very impressive works which can be called art or contribute to its evolution.<br/><br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "With the development of technology, many programs started to appear, among them image editing software. As computers became more advanced, these programs became more powerful and allowed creators to do more than just edit photos.<br/><br/>There are many evidences of the potential of these programs, with the development of 3D animation or even special effects in films, the work of these artists has become something that can be seen everywhere.<br/><br/>However, experts still wonder if this work can be considered as art. Some artists argue that nothing can compare to the feeling of canvas, for painters. Still, digital art has become increasingly impressive, especially because it can allow the work of art to interact with its audience in ways that have never been explored before."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fake"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "false, unauthentic or unoriginal"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The new version looks so fake."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "imply"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to mean, suggest or involve something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Because it implies the use of creativity and imagination."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unadorned, simple or with no taste"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In this movie it's the plainest form of art, if you ask me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "atrocious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "terrible, awful or very bad"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: As in any piece of art there are some people who think it's the most impressive or atrocious piece."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lack"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the absence or deficiency of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Using technology can't compensate for a lack of talent."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "enhance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to improve or rearrange in a good way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've also seen some beautiful images that have been enhanced with digital tools."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob03aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about the relationship between computer technology and art."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a short paragraph (about 200 words) explaining the relationship between computer technology and art."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Download your favorite picture and edit it using Adobe Photoshop or any other editing software."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your class and show your edited picture, explain it."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read about features between computer technology and art."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I summarize and write my thoughts about technology and art."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I edit a piece of art using my creativity."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my thoughts to the class and share my picture to the class."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}]}